style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"142\"><span style=\"font-size:14.666666984558105px\"><br>\r\n          </span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><br>\r\n          </span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:14.666666984558105px\">If I set the number of marker\r\n            covariates to &quot;2&quot;, I get:</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><br>\r\n          </span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"142\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><br>\r\n          </span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">If you have a moment, I’d appreciate some help\r\n            understanding what this means.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n          <li><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span>Does it mean that by\r\n                adding two covariates makes the QTL non-significant, the\r\n                QTL isn&#39;t actually there?</span></font></li>\r\n          <li><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span>Does it mean that\r\n                there just aren&#39;t any other QTL there besides the large\r\n                one on the 2nd chromosome?</span></font></li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Thank you. I hope you have a pleasant rest of your\r\n            week! Please let me know if any additional details would aid\r\n            you. </span></p>\r\n      </div></blockquote></div>"
